window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-133-080b70b4623fb346.json"]={sha256:"080b70b4623fb346e9542f8421c9a0dc76647954a695638bf04783555e78ced2",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-99c4cca2eb6400c5","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/smallsat-institute/sst-soa/soa-communications/","title":"Small Spacecraft Technology: Communications","titleEn":"Small Spacecraft Technology: Communications","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-133","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-133","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-134","referenceUrls":["https://ccsds.org/publications/bluebooks/"],"title":"CCSDS TM：固定框長與校驗開銷","titleEn":"CCSDS TM: fixed frame length and integrity overhead","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 120 decimal MB delivered 與 80 decimal MB delivered，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 120 decimal MB delivered and 80 decimal MB delivered, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋99.21875 percent useful bytes與96.875 percent useful bytes，建立tm_layout.csv、byte欄位示意、開銷與完整性分開報告，並完成以下驗收：題設效率至少98%時僅長框通過；須另提交受損框被拒收的測試才能驗資料完整性。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 99.21875 percent useful bytes and 96.875 percent useful bytes; create tm_layout.csv, a byte-field diagram and separate overhead/integrity reports; apply this acceptance decision: Only the longer frame meets an assumed98% efficiency target; integrity also requires evidence that corrupted frames are rejected.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 中繼有效容量等於毛資料率乘可用接觸時間與有效比例；一次過站不足時資料必須留在可持續保存的佇列。 展開基準式 2*600*0.8/8；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：獨立用每秒0.2 MB列接觸表；結束剩餘150-120=30或150-80=70 MB，已送加剩餘保持150。 將兩條推導一起存入 mars_contact.csv、每秒容量累加、150 MB資料守恆帳。","從原理 將教學框分成標頭、資料與校驗，可分別量測開銷與錯誤偵測；吞吐效率不能證明資料正確。 展開基準式 (1024-6-2)/1024*100；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：實際建立byte索引0到長度-1，逐個標記6標頭與2尾端byte；資料計數應為1016或248。 將兩條推導一起存入 tm_layout.csv、byte欄位示意、開銷與完整性分開報告。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Relay useful capacity is gross rate times usable contact duration times efficiency; data beyond one pass must remain in persistent storage., expand baseline expression 2*600*0.8/8; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Tabulate0.2 MB per second independently; remaining data is30 or70 MB and delivered plus remaining stays150 MB. Save both derivations with mars_contact.csv, per-second capacity accumulation and a150 MB data-conservation ledger.","Starting from Separating a teaching frame into header, data and check fields distinguishes overhead from error detection; efficiency alone does not establish integrity., expand baseline expression (1024-6-2)/1024*100; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Build byte indices from0 to length-1 and mark6 header and2 trailing bytes; data counts must be1016 or248. Save both derivations with tm_layout.csv, a byte-field diagram and separate overhead/integrity reports.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-143","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en"],"title":"OTDR：往返時間與斷點定位","titleEn":"OTDR: round-trip time and event localization","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 120 decimal MB delivered 與 80 decimal MB delivered，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 120 decimal MB delivered and 80 decimal MB delivered, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學定位容差0.1 km；若另一端推算不一致，保留疑點，不用最大峰直接判定斷纖。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching location tolerance0.1 km; keep the result unresolved if reverse-end localization disagrees, rather than declaring the largest peak a break.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 中繼有效容量等於毛資料率乘可用接觸時間與有效比例；一次過站不足時資料必須留在可持續保存的佇列。 展開基準式 2*600*0.8/8；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：獨立用每秒0.2 MB列接觸表；結束剩餘150-120=30或150-80=70 MB，已送加剩餘保持150。 將兩條推導一起存入 mars_contact.csv、每秒容量累加、150 MB資料守恆帳。","合成群速度2.0e8 m/s，發射零點校正後事件延遲100 µs；第二組120 µs；先扣除引線。 名義式 2e8*100e-6/2/1000 = 10 km；變更式 2e8*120e-6/2/1000 = 12 km。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 由距離反算往返時間；建立0、5、10 km三個已知標記檢查斜率與零點，再比較從另一端量測的位置。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Relay useful capacity is gross rate times usable contact duration times efficiency; data beyond one pass must remain in persistent storage., expand baseline expression 2*600*0.8/8; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Tabulate0.2 MB per second independently; remaining data is30 or70 MB and delivered plus remaining stays150 MB. Save both derivations with mars_contact.csv, per-second capacity accumulation and a150 MB data-conservation ledger.","Synthetic group velocity2.0e8 m/s and launch-corrected event delays100 and120 µs; subtract the launch fiber first. Nominal 2e8*100e-6/2/1000 = 10 km; changed 2e8*120e-6/2/1000 = 12 km. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Reconstruct round-trip time from distance; use known0,5,10 km markers for slope and offset and compare the opposite-end coordinate.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-047ba09e77c63aef","url":"https://ccsds.org/publications/bluebooks/","title":"CCSDS Blue Books: Recommended Standards","titleEn":"CCSDS Blue Books: Recommended Standards","publisher":"CCSDS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-1348db92caa214bd","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en","title":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","titleEn":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
